# 本文の端末ブロックから機械的に作った入力を、読者と同じ起動（docker run --rm -it --hostname linuc、
# 名前の無いボリューム2つ、PID 1 の bash -l、umask 022、TERM=xterm）の檻に、章ごとに起動し直して打った記録。
# 端末 80 桁 × 24 行（tmux）。画面に最後に残ったものを書く。作り方: python3 -I probe/linuc-packages-seq.py --script /dev/stdin --cage rpm（イメージ lab-linuc-packages-rpm:1.1.0）
# 本文の表と説明が拠っている yum・rpm・yumdownloader の説明


========== この檻には dnf・yum・rpm の man が無い ==========

$ man -w dnf yum rpm yumdownloader
No manual entry for dnf
No manual entry for yum
No manual entry for rpm
/usr/share/man/man1/yumdownloader.1.gz


========== 第9章・第10章: yum のサブコマンドの説明（yum help） ==========

$ yum help | grep -E '^(autoremove|check-update|clean|deplist|info|install|list|makecache|provides|reinstall|remove|repolist|repoquery|search|upgrade) '
autoremove                remove all unneeded packages that were originally installed as dependencies
check-update              check for available package upgrades
clean                     remove cached data
deplist                   [deprecated, use repoquery --deplist] List package's dependencies and what packages provide them
info                      display details about a package or group of packages
install                   install a package or packages on your system
list                      list a package or groups of packages
makecache                 generate the metadata cache
provides                  find what package provides the given value
reinstall                 reinstall a package
remove                    remove a package or packages from your system
repolist                  display the configured software repositories
repoquery                 search for packages matching keyword
search                    search package details for the given string
upgrade                   upgrade a package or packages on your system


========== 第10章: update は upgrade の、whatprovides は provides の、groupinstall は group の別名 ==========

$ yum update --help | head -1
usage: yum upgrade [-c CONFIG_FILE] [-q] [-v] [--version] [--installroot PATH]

$ yum whatprovides --help | head -1
usage: yum provides [-c CONFIG_FILE] [-q] [-v] [--version]

$ yum groupinstall --help | head -1
usage: yum group [-c CONFIG_FILE] [-q] [-v] [--version] [--installroot PATH]


========== 第10章・演習12: repoquery と yumdownloader は、dnf の働きを呼ぶ道具（yum-utils）へのリンク ==========

$ ls -l /usr/bin/repoquery /usr/bin/yumdownloader
lrwxrwxrwx 1 root root 22 Nov 12  2025 /usr/bin/repoquery -> /usr/libexec/dnf-utils
lrwxrwxrwx 1 root root 22 Nov 12  2025 /usr/bin/yumdownloader -> /usr/libexec/dnf-utils

$ rpm -qf /usr/bin/yumdownloader
yum-utils-4.3.0-24.el9_7.noarch

$ yumdownloader --help | head -1
usage: dnf download [-c CONFIG_FILE] [-q] [-v] [--version]

$ yumdownloader --help | grep -A1 -E '^  --(destdir|source|resolve) '
  --destdir DESTDIR, --downloaddir DESTDIR
                        set directory to copy packages to
--
  --source              download the src.rpm instead
  --debuginfo           download the -debuginfo package instead
--
  --resolve             resolve and download needed dependencies
  --alldeps             when running with --resolve, download all dependencies

$ grep -n -E "'yumdownloader'|basename" /usr/libexec/dnf-utils
41:           'yumdownloader': ['download']
77:command = os.path.basename(sys.argv[0])


